ne 7, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-553_ pf-heading-1-h3">Friday, June 7, 2024 — 9:00AM CDT — Russo: Elgin, IL</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-555_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Driving with the wrong&nbsp;license class can land you some pretty hefty fines. Anybody who drives a municipal or contractor vehicle will greatly benefit from the information presented here! <strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/itea-trucktrailer-safety-seminar-tickets-880258114717?aff=eventcal" target="_self">Reserve your Spot &gt;</a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-557_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-558_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">APWA CMC Expo &amp; ROADeo — May 22-23, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-560_ pf-heading-1-h3">DuPage Event Center &amp; Fairgrounds – Wheaton, IL</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-562_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">This two day event is a great way to see the latest equipment, tools, speak with vendors, attend education sessions and watch (or participate in) the end loader, snow plow, and backhoe competition.&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><a href="https://apwacmc.eventicket-register.com/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-564_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-565_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Chainsaw Safety &amp; Maintenance CEU Seminar, Afternoon</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-567_ pf-heading-1-h3">Friday, May 10, 2024 — 1:00PM CDT — Russo: Hainesville, IL</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-569_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-848731959137?aff=eventcal" target="_blank"></a>Earn <b>1.5 ISA CEUs</b> while learning about the best chainsaw safety practices from Andrew Guetler, a Gold Certified MasterWrench® Technician with Stihl. He will cover and discuss all the basics from chainsaw starting, usage, handling, maintenance, and more.  <a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-885734073457?aff=eventcal" target="_blank"><b>Reserve Your Spot Now! &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-571_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-572_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Chainsaw Safety &amp; Maintenance CEU Seminar, Morning</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-574_ pf-heading-1-h3">Friday, May 10, 2024 — 10:00AM CDT — Russo: Hainesville, IL</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-576_ pf-text-2 pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-848731959137?aff=eventcal" target="_blank"></a>Earn <b>1.5 ISA CEUs</b> while learning about the best chainsaw safety practices from Andrew Guetler, a Gold Certified MasterWrench® Technician with Stihl. He will cover and discuss all the basics from chainsaw starting, usage, handling, maintenance, and more.  <a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-857306746557?aff=eventcal" target="_blank"><b>Reserve Your Spot Now! &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-578_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-579_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Live, Online Auction — May 1</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-581_ pf-heading-1-h3">Wednesday, May 1, 2024</h3><p class="s