sition:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-622_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-623_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Chainsaw Safety &amp; Maintenance CEU Seminar - Illinois</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-625_ pf-heading-1-h3">Friday, March 15, 2024 — 9:00AM CDT — Russo: Frankfort</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-627_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Earn 1.5 ISA CEUs while learning about the best chainsaw safety practices from Andrew Guetler, a Gold Certified MasterWrench® Technician with Stihl. He will cover and discuss all the basics from chainsaw starting, usage, handling, maintenance, and more. <a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-848731959137?aff=eventcal" target="_self">Reserve Your Spot Now! &gt;</a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-629_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-630_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Spring Open House: RUSSO</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-632_ pf-heading-1-h3">Friday, March 15, 2024  |  All Russo Locations</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-634_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Spring Open House features representatives from the most prominent companies in the industry performing demos &amp; providing info on the newest products on the market. Save the date for a day full of fun, raffles, giveaways, and more.  <a href="/pages/spring-open-house" target="_self">Learn More &gt;</a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-636_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-637_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Hardscaper Showcase presented by Techo-Bloc —&nbsp;March 1</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-639_ pf-heading-1-h3">Embassy Suites By Hilton, 1823 Abriter Ct, Naperville, IL 60563</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-641_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Attend this&nbsp;FREE Seminar for Hardscape Professionals&nbsp;and visit Russo&nbsp;at the iQ Power Tools booth.&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><a href="https://events.hardscaper.com/event/?event=7918b5ba-5765-e66c-c303-3a0da71b9acf" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-643_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-644_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Fort Wayne Home &amp; Garden Show — February&nbsp;29 thru&nbsp;March 3, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-646_ pf-heading-1-h3">Allen County War Memorial Coliseum, 4000 Parnell Ave, Fort Wayne, IN 46805<br></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-648_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Attend the 51st Annual Fort Wayne Home &amp; Garden Show in Fort Wayne, IN and visit Russo&nbsp;at booth #251. 650+ exhibitors in attendance! Exhibitors feature products and services for kitchen, bath, landscaping, interior decor, bedding, windows, siding, roofing, gutters, patios, driveways, and more. &nbsp;<b><a href="https://home-gardenshow.com/about-the-show/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-650_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-651_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA Young Professionals Event</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-653_ pf-heading-1-h3">Thursday, February 15, 2024&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;Dave &amp; Buster's in Rosemont, IL</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-655_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Join ILCA's young professionals committee at
Dave &amp; Buster's in Rosemont, IL for their February event!
This event is limited to any landscape industry professional, student, or supplier age 35 or under.&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><first-sel><a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/young-professionals-event/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></first-sel></b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-657_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-658_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA&nbsp;iLandscape — January&nbsp;31 thru&nbsp;February 2, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-660_ pf-heading-1-h3">Renaissance Schaumburg Convention Center Hotel in Schaumburg, IL</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-662_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Attend the 11th annual iLandscape show &amp; sit in on educational sessions, talk with more than 400 exhibitors, and discover the latest trends in the green industry! Visit Russo at Booth #1729.&nbsp;<a href="https://ilandscapeshow.com/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a>&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-664_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-665_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">IAPD/IPRA Soaring to New Heights Conference — January&nbsp;25 - 26, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-667_ pf-heading-1-h3">Hyatt Regency Chicago</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-669_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">The IAPD/IPRA Soaring to New Heights Conference holds the unique distinction of being the largest state park and recreation conference in the nation. The conference brings together thousands of professionals, Commissioners, and elected officials from around the state for three exciting days of quality educational programming, networking, and professional development. Visit Russo at Booth #234.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.ilparksconference.com/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-671_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-672_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">IGE Indiana Green Expo&nbsp;— January&nbsp;18 - 19, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-674_ pf-heading-1-h3">Indiana Convention Center in Indianapolis, IN</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-676_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Indiana Green Expo 2024 two-day Trade Show provides opportunities for turf and landscape professionals to meet with vendors and view the newest products and technology. Plan to be a part of it! Visit Russo at Booth #118 &amp; Haltom at Booth #123.&nbsp;<a href="https://indianagreenexpo.com/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-678_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-679_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA&nbsp;InVigorateU Conference&nbsp;— January&nbsp;16 - 17, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-681_ pf-heading-1-h3">DoubleTree by Hilton in Bloomington, IL</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-683_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">InVigorateU is an annual education conference that not only offers great sessions and CEUs, but also offers a chance to reflect on what worked this season and collaborate with peers about what you might want to do differently in the next to get stronger results. Visit Russo at&nbsp;Booth #22.&nbsp;<a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/invigorateu/" target="_blank"><b>Learn More &gt;</b></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-685_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-686_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Herbicide &amp; Weed Identification Workshop</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-688_ pf-heading-1-h3">Wednesday, December 13, 2023&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;Midwest Golf House in&nbsp;Lemont, IL<br>Cosponsored by the ILCA Turf Committee and Midwest Regional Turf Foundation<br></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-690_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">This half-day workshop offers training in weed identification, integrated weed management, selecting the right herbicides, enhancing weed control, and updates on the latest weed research findings.&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/herbicide-weed-identification-workshop/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-692_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-693_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ILCA's Pruning Workshop</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-695_ pf-heading-1-h3">Thursday, November&nbsp;2, 2023&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;NIU Naperville Conference Center in Naperville, IL</h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-697_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Do you want to learn how to prune according to professional standards or have minimal pruning proficiency and need to brush up on basic pruning specifics? This is the class for you! This half-day class is taught in Spanish in the morning and English in the afternoon.&nbsp;&nbsp;<b><a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/pruning-workshop/" target="_blank">Learn More &gt;</a></b></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-699_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-700_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 4