rfect place to learn more about our diverse selection of in-stock trailers and parts. <a href="https://www.natda.org/trailer-show" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1001_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1005_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Tree Climbing From Ground to Crown— August 26</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1007_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Power Equipment - Elgin - 8am to 3pm<br></b><br>Receive 6 CEUs &amp; learn about the best tree climbing techniques and modern climbing gear from arbor expert Beau Nagan.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1009_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1013_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Lunch &amp; Learn: Building Plant Health with Soil Science— August 24</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1015_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">A 2nd chance to earn 3 CEUs while learning how to expand your business and keep your clients' plants happy &amp; healthy! Sponsored by ArborJet &amp; Ecologel.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1017_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1021_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>IAA Annual Golf Outing— August 19</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1023_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Salt Creek Golf Course in Wood Dale, IL<br><br>12pm - Lunch<br>1pm - Shot gun start<br>6pm - Dinner<br></b><br>The Illinois Arborist Association Golf Outing is always a fan favorite, so bring your game face and make sure you come to play!</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1025_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1029_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Lunch &amp; Learn: Building Plant Health with Soil Science— August 10</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1031_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Earn 3 CEUs while learning strategies to diversify your business and keep plants happy &amp; healthy! Sponsored by ArborJet &amp; Ecologel.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1033_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1037_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>ILCA Fire &amp; Ice Summer Field &amp; Snow Day— August 4</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1039_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Cantigny Park in Wheaton, IL<br></b><br>We’re going to be one of over 100 exhibitors at ILCA’s brand-new Fire &amp; Ice summer field and snow day, and we can’t wait to see you! <a href="https://ilca.net/ilca-events/fire-and-ice/" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1041_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1045_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>IAA Tree Climbing Championship — June 25</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1047_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Shiloh Park in Zion, IL<br><br>7am - Competitor gear check
8:15am - Competition preliminary events begin</b><br><br>We’re heading to the IAA Tree Climbing Championship for a day full of competition, fun, and outdoor activities. Our certified arborist, Dan, will be judging the competition and we'll have a booth at the fair. Stop by to learn more about all things arbor! <a href="https://illinoisarborist.org/2022-illinois-tree-climbing-championship/" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1049_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1053_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live Online Auction — June 15</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1055_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Elgin </b>- 1001 N Randall Rd, Elgin, IL 60123, USA<b><br><br>Consign By:</b> 5/21   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 6/14</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1057_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1061_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Chainsaw Safety Seminar — June 10</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1063_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Russo Hainesville </b>- 39 East Belvidere Road, Hainesville, IL 60030, USA<br><br>Earn 1.5 ISA CEUs while learning about the best chainsaw safety practices from a certified chainsaw technician. We’ll cover and discuss all the basics from chainsaw starting, usage, handling, maintenance, and more.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1065_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1069_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>APWA Chicago Expo &amp; Roadeo — May 18 &amp; 19</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1071_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Odeum Expo Center in Villa Park, IL</b><br><br>While attending the APWA Expo, stop by our booth, say hi, and we’ll fill you in on all of the exciting news and equipment we have in stock! <a href="http://chicago.apwa.net/Content/Chapters/chicago.apwa.net/Documents/2022%20APWA%20CMC%20Expo%20Exhibitor%20Sponsor%20Information(3).pdf" target="_self">More Info &gt;</a></p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1073_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1077_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;In-Person Auction — April 9</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1079_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Auction begins at 8:00am at Russo:</b> Hainesville   |   <b>Preview Day:</b> 04/08, Hainesville<br><br>After a long break due to Covid, we're excited to announce the return of our in-person auction! Plan to spend the day bidding on an assortment of high-quality used equipment.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1081_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1085_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Russo Spring Open House</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1087_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We’re happy to announce the long-awaited return of the Russo Open House! Spring Open House features representatives from the most prominent companies in the industry putting on demonstrations and informing customers of the newest products on the market. Save the date for a day full of fun, raffles, giveaways, and more.</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1089_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1093_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Live&nbsp;Online Auction — March 16</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1095_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>No Consignment   |   Preview Day:</b> 03/15, Elgin</p><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-gHjzna jjXpKn pf-1097_ pf-divider-1"></div><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ckSceh cxDqq pf-1101_ pf-heading-1-h3"><b>Service Hiring Event at Schiller Park — March 10 &amp; 11</b></h3><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-1103_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>In-person Interviews &amp; On-the-spot Offers<br></b><br>Meet the staff, see the space, have some food, and have an in-person interview with potential offers! We're hiring multiple people for 3 positions: Service Porters, Service Mechanics, &amp; Lead Service Advisor. All mechanic levels from apprentice to master are welcome to apply! Visit <a href="/pages/careers" target="_self">RussoPower.com/careers</a>&nbsp;7 to see all job opportunities!</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
